---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Story" description="Your story isn't landing. Let's fix that.">
  <section class="hero-small">
    <span class="tenet-label">Core Tenet</span>
    <h1>"We're losing deals to <span class="highlight">dumber competitors</span>"</h1>
    <p class="hero-answer">Your story isn't landing. Let's fix that.</p>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">The Problem</h2>
    <div class="problem-text">
      <p>
        You have a better product. Better people. Better track record.
        But somehow, clients choose competitors who seem... inferior.
      </p>
      <p>
        The issue isn't your solution. It's your story.
      </p>
      <p>
        You're selling features when clients buy outcomes. You're explaining what you do 
        instead of what problem you solve. You're speaking your language, not theirs.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">How I Help</h2>
    <div class="approach">
      <div class="approach-item">
        <h3>Find Your Big Problem</h3>
        <p>Every business was created to solve a problem. Most have forgotten what it is. I find it through research with your customers and colleagues.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="approach-item">
        <h3>Craft Your Solution Story</h3>
        <p>Turn your big problem into a narrative so clear that everyone — sales, board, customers — finally gets it.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="approach-item">
        <h3>Embed It Everywhere</h3>
        <p>Your story should permeate pitches, website, sales decks, even internal comms. Consistency creates clarity.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">Related Work</h2>
    <div class="related-work">
      <a href="/work#the-stack" class="work-link">
        <span class="work-title">The Stack</span>
        <span class="work-desc">Investigative journalism with depth layers</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/work#data-detectives" class="work-link">
        <span class="work-title">Data Detectives</span>
        <span class="work-desc">Business fable on breaking silos</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section cta-section">
    <h2>Ready to get your story straight?</h2>
    <a href="mailto:dave@wordandmouth.com" class="cta-button">Let's Talk</a>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero-small {
    padding: 10rem 2rem 4rem;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  
  .tenet-label {
    display: inline-block;
    background: rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.15);
    color: var(--accent);
    padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .hero-small h1 {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  
  .hero-answer {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  
  .problem-text p {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 700px;
  }
  
  .approach {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem;
  }
  
  .approach-item {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    background: #111;
  }
  
  .approach-item h3 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  
  .approach-item p {
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  
  .related-work {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  
  .work-link {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: #111;
    border-left: 3px solid transparent;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }
  
  .work-link:hover {
    border-left-color: var(--accent);
  }
  
  .work-title {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  
  .work-desc {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  
  .cta-section {
    text-align: center;
  }
  
  .cta-section h2 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
</style>
